WEBVTT

00:01.800 --> 00:03.020
Thank you.

00:04.650 --> 00:08.520
I heard that Sir Kamil and 
Elsie won't receive punishment.

00:09.270 --> 00:11.900
It's nothing to thank me for.

00:12.210 --> 00:15.600
While I'm thinking of it, I heard that 
the policies for improving the slums

00:15.600 --> 00:19.540
are going to move forward under 
your leadership, Prince Theodore.

00:21.160 --> 00:24.000
My brother asked me if I wanted to do it.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.290
Then, does that mean the both of you 
will be attending to official matters?

00:29.490 --> 00:32.030
Well, I suppose it does.

00:32.780 --> 00:36.550
Now, you didn't take the trouble to 
come here just to say that, did you?

00:37.390 --> 00:40.430
Actually, I have a favor to ask of you.

00:43.020 --> 00:43.670
What?

00:44.310 --> 00:48.190
This is something which will be 
essential for your brother as well.

00:48.650 --> 00:53.190
What do I do? I have no idea 
what my sister-in-law is saying.

00:53.600 --> 00:56.130
Please, Prince Theodore.

02:30.560 --> 02:32.350
The preparations are complete.

02:34.580 --> 02:36.510
I'll be off now.

02:36.780 --> 02:37.720
Yes, my lady!

02:42.230 --> 02:45.070
An official letter from the 
Kingdom of Coyolles has arrived.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.710
Come in.

03:01.200 --> 03:03.930
How are you faring, Prince Arnold?

03:03.930 --> 03:07.790
Thank you for granting me your 
time in spite of how busy you are.

03:08.080 --> 03:10.290
What sort of business brings you here?

03:10.290 --> 03:14.280
You seem too tense to have come 
simply to see your fiancé's face.

03:20.620 --> 03:23.800
A room has been prepared for you 
at the villa, Your Highness.

03:24.160 --> 03:24.950
What?

03:25.690 --> 03:29.280
If you have the time, may I 
show you the room now?

03:29.280 --> 03:32.310
Why would this errand make you so nervous?

03:32.610 --> 03:36.060
My maids have worked 
eagerly and diligently on it.

03:36.060 --> 03:38.910
It's almost like a graduation exam for them.

03:39.570 --> 03:44.280
However, I can confidently assert that the 
room they've prepared is quite lovely.

03:45.360 --> 03:49.790
I had thought it was your wish 
to live in that villa alone.

03:49.790 --> 03:51.400
Of course not!

03:51.400 --> 03:55.170
I want to live there with you, Prince Arnold.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.730
I see.

03:58.400 --> 04:01.300
It seems you're plotting 
something amusing yet again.

04:01.300 --> 04:03.590
You make me sound awful!

04:04.030 --> 04:05.050
Very well.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.510
I'll go along with your scheme.

04:07.510 --> 04:09.680
Thanks to you, my mood has improved.

04:10.590 --> 04:12.430
Your mood?

04:12.430 --> 04:13.480
Let's go.

04:19.520 --> 04:21.190
Thank you.

04:25.390 --> 04:27.530
This is your private bedroom, Your Highness.

04:28.080 --> 04:31.050
What do you think? It's a 
splendid room, isn't it?

04:31.050 --> 04:32.830
Very impressive.

04:33.060 --> 04:36.710
This villa has been left 
abandoned for many years.

04:36.960 --> 04:39.170
You've been here a mere three weeks.

04:39.170 --> 04:40.910
To think you've already
improved it this much.

04:40.910 --> 04:42.580
Thank you!

04:42.580 --> 04:44.840
You taught the novices starting 
with the basics, didn't you?

04:44.840 --> 04:48.970
Yes. Once they've learned a trade, they'll 
be able to make their living anywhere.

04:48.970 --> 04:50.990
And they'll gain something else, too.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.480
Pride.

04:54.010 --> 04:57.550
When they accomplish their work 
and earn the praise of another,

04:57.550 --> 04:58.880
it will give them a sense of pride.

04:59.510 --> 05:02.190
That sort of pride can help a person 
make the most of themselves.

05:02.700 --> 05:06.570
You have a talent for giving 
people a sense of self-respect.

05:10.280 --> 05:12.980
That's the expression you 
make when I compliment you?

05:14.270 --> 05:17.320
You're teasing me, aren't you?

05:17.320 --> 05:19.420
It may not seem like it, 
but it's heartfelt praise.

05:19.910 --> 05:21.570
Well, it's just too bad for you.

05:21.570 --> 05:25.970
Even if it's a lie, receiving a compliment 
from you makes me very happy.

05:28.650 --> 05:32.620
Out of the whole villa, this 
room gets the best light.

05:38.080 --> 05:40.590
The wind feels wonderful 
when you open the window,

05:40.590 --> 05:42.820
so it's perfect for an afternoon 
nap, don't you think?

05:43.180 --> 05:45.580
I never return to my chambers during the day.

05:46.140 --> 05:48.450
This room is next to yours, isn't it?

05:48.450 --> 05:52.580
Yes. I thought that would 
make it easier for the guards.

05:52.800 --> 05:54.000
And for me.

05:54.000 --> 05:54.770
What?

05:54.770 --> 05:57.700
Because I'll get wind of your 
reckless behavior beforehand.

05:57.700 --> 06:01.460
I'm planning to spend my time lazing about, 
so I won't be doing anything reckless.

06:02.960 --> 06:04.460
Not much, anyway.

06:04.460 --> 06:05.630
Idiot.

06:06.140 --> 06:07.750
You're free to do what you want,

06:07.750 --> 06:10.320
but don't do anything as reckless 
as you did the other day.

06:10.320 --> 06:11.930
I'm very sorry.

06:13.010 --> 06:17.050
Speaking of which, do you remember what we 
talked about at the party the other evening?

06:17.050 --> 06:17.850
What do you mean?

06:18.420 --> 06:21.480
When you said that you wanted 
to try sparring with me.

06:23.470 --> 06:26.790
It might be worthwhile for me to 
try sparring with you one day.

06:26.790 --> 06:29.280
I would like that very much!

06:29.940 --> 06:32.240
Yes, we did say that.

06:32.240 --> 06:33.750
Just once would be enough.

06:33.750 --> 06:35.620
Would you instruct me?

06:35.620 --> 06:40.370
Teach me using the special training methods 
Your Highness and the imperial knights use.

06:41.340 --> 06:43.630
What makes you say that they're special?

06:44.330 --> 06:48.800
Since coming to this palace, I've watched 
everyone train a number of times,

06:48.800 --> 06:53.510
but Your Highness' and the imperial knights' 
movement is clearly different from the rest.

06:56.680 --> 06:57.680
All right.

06:57.680 --> 07:00.350
What? Are you sure?

07:00.970 --> 07:05.110
I did promise to do anything 
you wished, after all.

07:05.110 --> 07:08.320
Oh, um... Thank you.

07:08.880 --> 07:10.860
That makes me incredibly happy.

07:11.400 --> 07:12.740
Happy?

07:13.220 --> 07:20.750
As far as I know, your sword work is the 
most beautiful, most powerful in all the world.

07:22.030 --> 07:23.990
In all the world, huh?

07:24.760 --> 07:27.000
Th-That's just a turn of phrase, of course!

07:27.590 --> 07:32.320
A skill that's only meant for killing 
people can't possibly be beautiful.

07:32.770 --> 07:33.890
Your Highness...

07:35.480 --> 07:37.670
I'll head to the practice 
grounds ahead of you.

07:37.670 --> 07:39.500
Change into some clothes
that you can move in.

07:43.370 --> 07:46.600
Is this how you always practice?

07:46.600 --> 07:48.400
Not always.

07:48.400 --> 07:52.150
Once you've acquired an incorrect habit, 
it's too late to do anything about it.

07:52.150 --> 07:56.960
The arm and leg restraints are meant to 
help closely mimic battlefield conditions,

07:56.960 --> 07:59.660
so that you can continue to fight 
even if you've lost a limb.

08:00.210 --> 08:02.290
That's what this training is for, isn't it?

08:03.330 --> 08:06.290
As usual, your observations are impressive.

08:06.740 --> 08:09.300
Even if my arm is ripped off, 
I'll keep swinging my sword.

08:09.300 --> 08:12.050
Even if my leg is shattered, 
I'll continue to advance.

08:12.050 --> 08:14.330
And even if I should lose both my eyes,

08:14.330 --> 08:17.550
I'll keep looking, to the very last, 
for a path to cut down my enemy.

08:18.000 --> 08:21.360
Doing that will lead to 
a way for me to survive.

08:21.960 --> 08:26.770
I've heard that a knight's path 
pursues nobility and beauty.

08:27.530 --> 08:31.380
However, they will find a way to survive, no 
matter how unsightly their struggles may be.

08:31.380 --> 08:33.460
It's to survive that they kill their enemies.

08:34.110 --> 08:36.950
That way of thinking comes from 
Your Highness, doesn't it?

08:38.100 --> 08:40.450
<i>It's no wonder I was no match for him.</i>

08:40.450 --> 08:42.110
Don't worry.

08:42.110 --> 08:46.960
I have no intention of injuring an opponent 
who's preparing for their marriage ceremony.

08:49.500 --> 08:54.090
If I win, will you give me an answer 
to one question, no matter what it is?

08:55.010 --> 09:01.350
In exchange, if I lose, I'll grant one wish 
of Your Highness', no matter what it may be.

09:02.870 --> 09:04.100
Very well.

09:04.300 --> 09:06.820
Then, if you would.

09:07.350 --> 09:08.500
Begin!

09:11.540 --> 09:14.260
<i>The longer our exchange of blows lasts, 
the greater my disadvantage.</i>

09:20.080 --> 09:21.560
<i>A frontal attack!</i>

09:26.970 --> 09:29.370
What's wrong? Is that all you've got?

09:30.540 --> 09:32.750
<i>My center of balance is unstable.</i>

09:32.750 --> 09:36.260
<i>My instincts are trying to make me move 
the way I do when I can use my left arm.</i>

09:36.920 --> 09:40.760
<i>If I adjust my center of 
balance... my reach will change.</i>

09:41.700 --> 09:43.430
<i>I'll have to step in closer!</i>

09:45.600 --> 09:47.850
Your movement's dulled!
 Don't rely on strength alone!

09:48.450 --> 09:49.860
Your footwork is growing careless!

09:50.230 --> 09:51.860
Make use of your nimbleness.

09:52.270 --> 09:53.440
Step in farther!

09:54.360 --> 09:55.490
Another step.

09:55.490 --> 09:56.110
Still not there.

09:56.110 --> 09:57.110
You see?

09:59.820 --> 10:01.810
<i>He really is impressive.</i>

10:01.810 --> 10:03.720
<i>In this short exchange of blows,</i>

10:03.720 --> 10:06.830
<i>he's telling me exactly what 
points I need to improve upon.</i>

10:09.830 --> 10:14.810
It's only been a little while since Lady 
Rishe crossed swords with His Highness, but...

10:14.810 --> 10:18.590
You're right. In the blink of an eye, 
her movements have already improved.

10:26.220 --> 10:27.740
<i>Next, he'll come from above!</i>

10:34.650 --> 10:37.390
<i>The same move as back then.</i>

10:38.000 --> 10:42.140
<i>But even if I understand what's 
happening, my body can't keep up.</i>

10:43.370 --> 10:47.280
Earlier, you said that my sword 
was the most powerful, didn't you?

10:47.880 --> 10:52.670
But that movement just now was that of 
someone who knows of a person stronger than me.

10:53.600 --> 10:57.990
Even as you're sparring with me, you're 
thinking of that person, aren't you?

10:59.700 --> 11:00.910
How enviable.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.960
I'm on the verge of becoming jealous.

11:06.160 --> 11:07.640
You jest.

11:08.110 --> 11:14.560
As I told you, you are the strongest 
person I know, Prince Arnold.

11:15.480 --> 11:20.580
<i>It's true. The prince of five years in the 
future was even stronger than he is now.</i>

11:20.580 --> 11:22.720
<i>He was cruel and overwhelmingly formidable.</i>

11:25.230 --> 11:26.100
Come at me.

11:27.300 --> 11:29.290
Focus on me a just little more.

11:48.780 --> 11:49.520
I'm not done yet!

12:04.680 --> 12:06.310
Very impressive.

12:06.310 --> 12:08.830
I wasn't planning on moving a single step.

12:10.010 --> 12:14.080
It seems you limited yourself 
quite a bit for my sake.

12:14.580 --> 12:17.590
Though it appears I greatly 
underestimated you.

12:18.700 --> 12:21.120
Thank you for your instruction.

12:22.560 --> 12:26.340
You'll do any one thing 
I want, is that right?

12:26.340 --> 12:28.840
Yes. Ask whatever you like of me.

12:28.840 --> 12:30.350
I won't go back on my word.

12:31.560 --> 12:34.720
Then, clear your afternoon 
for two days from now.

12:34.720 --> 12:35.980
We're going into town.

12:35.980 --> 12:39.770
Into town? To do what?

12:39.770 --> 12:41.260
I'll tell you when the time comes.

12:44.010 --> 12:46.110
What's wrong? Stand up.

12:49.990 --> 12:51.620
Um...

12:52.220 --> 12:54.970
I'm going to stay like this a little longer.

12:54.970 --> 12:57.250
Please go ahead and return without me.

12:57.250 --> 12:58.160
Why?

13:00.480 --> 13:05.880
The truth is... due to our sparring just 
now, my arms and legs are shaking.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.530
What?

13:07.530 --> 13:10.140
It seems my body wasn't able to keep up.

13:10.570 --> 13:13.070
So I'm going to rest a little.

13:15.090 --> 13:16.270
Your Highness?

13:16.900 --> 13:20.400
I'll only be touching you through my 
gloves, so it won't be a problem, right?

13:21.030 --> 13:21.480
What?

13:21.480 --> 13:22.980
What? Wait, Your Highness!

13:31.030 --> 13:32.640
Stop struggling. You'll fall.

13:32.640 --> 13:34.490
Um, it's just that this is...

13:34.490 --> 13:35.410
You can't stand, right?

13:35.410 --> 13:38.290
I can stand! I will stand! 
Please put me down!

13:38.290 --> 13:40.890
I can't go back and just leave 
my fiancée behind, can I?

13:40.890 --> 13:43.630
That may be true, but...

13:45.520 --> 13:48.740
While I'm thinking of it, 
what did you want to ask me?

13:48.740 --> 13:49.260
What?

13:49.660 --> 13:54.110
You said that if you won, I'd have 
to answer one question, right?

13:54.110 --> 13:56.270
Do you really think I
can ask you like this?

13:57.310 --> 13:58.270
You're laughing?

13:58.580 --> 14:02.020
I knew it! You're having fun 
watching my reactions, aren't you?

14:02.020 --> 14:03.180
Am I?

14:03.780 --> 14:05.910
Then, when is your birthday?

14:05.910 --> 14:08.030
The 28th day of the 12th month.

14:08.030 --> 14:10.970
Oh, so you were born in the winter! 
Next, what are your interests?

14:10.970 --> 14:12.160
I don't have any in particular.

14:12.160 --> 14:14.250
What sorts of things do 
you like, Your Highness?

14:14.250 --> 14:16.050
I've never really thought about it.

14:16.050 --> 14:17.840
What type of woman do you prefer?

14:17.840 --> 14:20.270
And what are you planning 
to gain by asking that?

14:32.490 --> 14:33.850
Master Oliver.

14:34.330 --> 14:36.170
Well, well. Lady Rishe.

14:36.170 --> 14:38.320
Are you moving the office now?

14:38.320 --> 14:42.860
Yes. Thank you for preparing such 
a wonderful room for His Highness.

14:43.200 --> 14:44.180
Not at all.

14:44.650 --> 14:46.480
By the way, where is the prince?

14:47.030 --> 14:50.790
Actually, last night he suddenly had 
to take command of the night watch,

14:50.790 --> 14:52.120
so he hasn't slept yet.

14:52.120 --> 14:53.170
What?

14:53.170 --> 14:57.200
I've implored him to take a nap, but 
he has his official duties to perform.

14:57.200 --> 14:59.520
He doesn't show any signs of resting.

15:03.910 --> 15:06.380
Please rest, Your Highness.

15:06.380 --> 15:09.040
Oliver said something unnecessary, didn't he?

15:09.040 --> 15:11.130
Staying up all night 
will take its toll on your body.

15:11.540 --> 15:13.140
I won't be able to sleep anyway.

15:13.610 --> 15:17.950
During the day, I can feel all sorts 
of people's presences in the palace.

15:20.350 --> 15:21.520
All right.

15:24.050 --> 15:27.840
Then I shall lull you 
to sleep, Prince Arnold.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.500
What?

15:36.960 --> 15:42.490
Now then, I will stay by your side, 
so please don't worry, just rest.

15:44.130 --> 15:48.340
Sometimes you say things 
that make no sense at all.

15:48.340 --> 15:53.540
If I'm here, I don't think you'll 
be distracted by far off presences.

15:53.540 --> 15:55.080
You're right about that.

15:55.080 --> 15:57.890
Then please, get some rest.

16:23.600 --> 16:25.430
This doesn't seem to be working.

16:29.070 --> 16:30.800
May I lie by your side?

16:38.990 --> 16:40.460
Pardon the intrusion.

16:53.800 --> 16:56.440
What are you doing?

16:56.980 --> 17:01.890
Imitating a heartbeat like this is a 
technique for calming the heart and mind.

17:03.520 --> 17:08.140
<i>In my life as a maid, I 
often used to do this for my lady.</i>

17:08.840 --> 17:12.960
If you do this for a young child, 
they'll quickly fall asleep.

17:13.450 --> 17:14.970
A young child?

17:18.030 --> 17:21.810
You're probably the only person 
who would treat me like that.

17:44.410 --> 17:46.270
If you're curious about 
it, do whatever you like.

18:02.390 --> 18:03.520
Stop that.

18:04.370 --> 18:05.680
You really...

18:05.680 --> 18:09.270
I-I'm sorry. That must have tickled.

18:11.020 --> 18:14.220
If we were going to do this, 
then I should have worn gloves.

18:14.730 --> 18:18.560
If I had, then I could 
have made a counter-stroke.

18:18.560 --> 18:23.370
It isn't as though touching me with gloves 
or through cloth makes it all right!

18:24.310 --> 18:25.400
It was a joke.

18:32.480 --> 18:36.400
<i>His Highness is so sincere 
and oddly conscientious.</i>

18:38.680 --> 18:41.410
<i>While I, on the other hand...</i>

18:46.600 --> 18:47.640
Please go ahead.

18:49.840 --> 18:50.860
And do what?

18:51.710 --> 18:53.690
I felt I wasn't being fair.

18:54.390 --> 18:56.860
If it would make Your Highness feel better,

18:56.860 --> 18:59.950
then you should touch me 
and have your reven—

18:59.950 --> 19:02.540
Are you doing this on purpose?

19:02.540 --> 19:03.870
Honestly, Your Highness!

19:08.010 --> 19:12.300
For my revenge... I'll show mercy and 
settle for that expression of yours.

19:14.800 --> 19:16.290
You're a strange one.

19:16.290 --> 19:18.640
You think nothing of sleeping beside me,

19:18.640 --> 19:21.650
but meeting my eyes when we're 
this close unsettles you.

19:23.290 --> 19:25.600
I wanted to put a charm on you.

19:25.600 --> 19:26.470
A charm?

19:26.900 --> 19:29.610
This palace isn't a battlefield.

19:29.610 --> 19:31.480
It's Your Highness' home, isn't it?

19:31.480 --> 19:36.860
That's why I hoped you would feel even a 
little more at ease so that you could sleep.

19:37.450 --> 19:40.780
Then stay here until I fall asleep.

19:42.110 --> 19:45.610
It's far more pleasant than an empty room.

19:48.080 --> 19:49.420
All right.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.980
You're awake?

20:11.560 --> 20:13.900
Your Highness...

20:16.960 --> 20:19.150
Prince Arnold, why are you here?

20:19.150 --> 20:22.530
Don't you remember climbing 
into this bed yourself?

20:24.100 --> 20:26.550
W-Were you able to sleep?

20:26.550 --> 20:29.180
That's the first thing you want to know?

20:30.530 --> 20:32.400
In any case, I do beg your pardon.

20:32.400 --> 20:34.790
I'll leave your room right 
away. Please don't worry.

20:34.210 --> 20:34.790
Wait.

20:35.020 --> 20:35.630
Huh?

20:36.030 --> 20:36.740
Wha—

20:39.040 --> 20:40.300
Excuse me, Your Highness!

20:40.790 --> 20:43.400
Stay quiet for just a little while.

20:47.050 --> 20:47.820
Come in.

20:50.660 --> 20:51.680
What's wrong?

20:52.100 --> 20:56.190
We've received reports. Were you sleeping?

20:56.190 --> 20:59.430
Lady Rishe spoke to you, then.

20:59.430 --> 21:03.200
If you're able to spend time 
comfortably in your new chambers,

21:03.200 --> 21:04.450
then that's wonderful.

21:04.450 --> 21:07.320
Keep it brief. I'll listen to it here.

21:07.870 --> 21:09.500
As you command.

21:12.830 --> 21:15.120
Then, I'll go back to work.

21:15.120 --> 21:17.110
Please be sure to rest thoroughly.

21:17.110 --> 21:18.580
Stop nagging.

21:18.580 --> 21:20.350
I understand, so hurry up and go away.

21:20.350 --> 21:21.340
Yes, of course.

21:21.840 --> 21:23.590
Well then, good night.

21:29.820 --> 21:30.840
It's all right now.

21:31.270 --> 21:33.350
I-I know.

21:33.800 --> 21:35.820
I know, but...

21:44.980 --> 21:47.290
Welcome back, Lady Rishe.

21:47.290 --> 21:49.120
Thank you, Elsie.

21:49.380 --> 21:52.090
A package has arrived from 
the Aria Trading Company.

21:52.920 --> 21:54.060
Thank you.

22:01.920 --> 22:04.660
<i>Starting tomorrow, I'm going to be very busy.</i>

22:07.600 --> 22:12.390
That will be the ten day training schedule 
for all of you knight candidates.

22:13.040 --> 22:15.140
I have high hopes for your progress.

22:15.390 --> 22:16.520
Yes, sir!
